{"seq":3,"slug":"volatility-surface","title":"波动率曲面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/options-basics/pricing-greeks/volatility-surface","wordCount":2388,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"波动率曲面\">波动率曲面</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>波动率曲面把&quot;波动率&quot;从单一数字升级为<strong>关于行权价与到期日的二维函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV(K, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。理解它需要先区分三种波动率，再看曲面的两种切面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三种波动率</strong>：HV（过去已发生）、IV（市场对未来的预期）、RV（未来实际发生）——期权交易的本质是赌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 的相对大小</li>\n<li><strong>微笑维度（沿 K）</strong>：同一到期日下 IV 随行权价变化的形状——股票/ETF 常呈偏斜（OTM Put 更贵），外汇呈对称微笑</li>\n<li><strong>期限结构维度（沿 T）</strong>：同一行权价下 IV 随到期时间变化的形状——事件驱动时近月高企</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>度量对象</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HV</td>\n<td>历史价格序列</td>\n<td>向后看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>期权市场价格</td>\n<td>向前看（含风险溢价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RV</td>\n<td>未来实际价格</td>\n<td>事后可验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"波动率的两种度量\">波动率的两种度量</h2><p>在期权交易中，&quot;波动率&quot;有两种根本不同的含义，理解它们的区别是进行波动率交易的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"历史波动率-historical-volatility-hv\">历史波动率（Historical Volatility, HV）</h3><p>历史波动率是标的资产<strong>过去一段时间</strong>实际价格变动的统计度量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>252</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HV = \\sigma_{realized} = \\sqrt{\\frac{252}{N-1} \\sum_{i=1}^{N}(r_i - \\bar{r})^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3338em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0561em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.2938em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">252</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.0161em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2938em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.3738em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.3738em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3373\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3239l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i = \\ln(S_i / S_{i-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为日对数收益率，252 为年化交易日。</p>\n<p>常用的历史波动率周期：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HV10</strong>：过去 10 个交易日（约 2 周）</li>\n<li><strong>HV20</strong>：过去 20 个交易日（约 1 个月）</li>\n<li><strong>HV60</strong>：过去 60 个交易日（约 3 个月）</li>\n<li><strong>HV252</strong>：过去 252 个交易日（1 年）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"隐含波动率-implied-volatility-iv\">隐含波动率（Implied Volatility, IV）</h3><p>隐含波动率是从期权市场价格反推出的波动率，反映市场对<strong>未来</strong>波动率的预期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hv-vs-iv-的本质区别\">HV vs IV 的本质区别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>历史波动率 HV</th>\n<th>隐含波动率 IV</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间方向</td>\n<td>向后看（已发生的）</td>\n<td>向前看（预期的）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>标的价格历史数据</td>\n<td>期权市场价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>确定的（事后可验证）</td>\n<td>不确定的（含风险溢价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>估计波动率水平</td>\n<td>期权定价、策略决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可交易性</td>\n<td>不可直接交易</td>\n<td>可通过期权头寸交易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"已实现波动率-realized-volatility-rv\">已实现波动率（Realized Volatility, RV）</h3><p>已实现波动率是未来某段时间<strong>实际发生</strong>的波动率。事前不可知，事后才能计算。</p>\n<p><strong>期权交易的本质</strong>：买入期权 = 以 IV 的价格&quot;买入&quot;未来的波动率 → 如果 RV &gt; IV，买方获利。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[波动率] --&gt; B[历史波动率 HV]&#10;    A --&gt; C[隐含波动率 IV]&#10;    A --&gt; D[已实现波动率 RV]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[过去的事实]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[市场的预期]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[未来的事实]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|&quot;IV &gt; RV?&quot;| E[卖方获利]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|&quot;IV &lt; RV?&quot;| F[买方获利]&#10;\">graph LR\n    A[波动率] --&gt; B[历史波动率 HV]\n    A --&gt; C[隐含波动率 IV]\n    A --&gt; D[已实现波动率 RV]\n    B --&gt; B1[过去的事实]\n    C --&gt; C1[市场的预期]\n    D --&gt; D1[未来的事实]\n    C1 --&gt;|\"IV &gt; RV?\"| E[卖方获利]\n    C1 --&gt;|\"IV &lt; RV?\"| F[买方获利]\n</pre><h2 id=\"波动率微笑-volatility-smile\">波动率微笑（Volatility Smile）</h2><h3 id=\"定义\">定义</h3><p>将同一到期日、不同行权价的期权隐含波动率画出来，形成的曲线称为波动率微笑。如果 BSM 完美成立，这条曲线应该是水平直线，但实际中它呈现特定形状。</p>\n<h3 id=\"股票-etf-市场的偏斜-skew\">股票/ETF 市场的偏斜（Skew）</h3><p>中国 A 股 ETF 期权市场呈现典型的左偏斜（Put Skew）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行权价位置</th>\n<th>隐含波动率</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度 OTM Put</td>\n<td>最高（+5~10%）</td>\n<td>崩盘保险需求 + 厚尾风险定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浅 OTM Put</td>\n<td>较高（+2~5%）</td>\n<td>对冲需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATM</td>\n<td>基准水平</td>\n<td>流动性最好的参考点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浅 OTM Call</td>\n<td>略低（-1~2%）</td>\n<td>备兑卖出压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度 OTM Call</td>\n<td>低或略回升</td>\n<td>尾部事件 + 流动性溢价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"偏斜的量化指标\">偏斜的量化指标</h3><p><strong>25-Delta Skew</strong>：25-Delta Put 的 IV 减去 25-Delta Call 的 IV</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Skew_{25Δ} = IV_{25Δ Put} - IV_{25Δ Call}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>正值（常态）：表示市场对下跌风险的定价高于上涨</li>\n<li>数值越大：市场恐慌程度越高</li>\n<li>中国 50ETF 期权正常 Skew 约 3-6%，恐慌时可达 15% 以上</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"外汇市场的微笑-smile\">外汇市场的微笑（Smile）</h3><p>外汇期权呈现更对称的微笑形态——两端都高。这是因为货币对的涨跌是对称的（美元跌 = 人民币涨），没有天然的方向性偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"波动率期限结构-term-structure\">波动率期限结构（Term Structure）</h2><h3 id=\"定义\">定义</h3><p>将同一行权价（通常是 ATM）、不同到期日的隐含波动率画出来，形成波动率的期限结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见形态\">常见形态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>市场环境</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常（Contango）</td>\n<td>远月 IV &gt; 近月 IV</td>\n<td>市场平静，远期不确定性更大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒挂（Backwardation）</td>\n<td>近月 IV &gt; 远月 IV</td>\n<td>近期有重大事件（财报、政策）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平坦</td>\n<td>各期限 IV 接近</td>\n<td>市场对未来预期稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驼峰</td>\n<td>中期 IV 最高</td>\n<td>中期有已知事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"期限结构的交易含义\">期限结构的交易含义</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>正常结构</strong>：日历价差策略（卖近买远）有天然优势</li>\n<li><strong>倒挂结构</strong>：日历价差不利，反向日历（买近卖远）可能更优</li>\n<li><strong>倒挂 → 正常</strong>：事件过后波动率回落，近月 IV 下降最快</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"波动率曲面-volatility-surface\">波动率曲面（Volatility Surface）</h2><h3 id=\"三维结构\">三维结构</h3><p>将行权价（或 Delta/Moneyness）和到期时间作为两个轴，隐含波动率作为第三个轴，形成三维曲面。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 或 </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IV = f(K, T)\\ 或\\ IV = f(\\Delta, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>波动率曲面是期权定价的<strong>完整信息</strong>——知道了曲面上每一点的 IV，就能给出市场上每一张期权的理论价格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"曲面的动态变化\">曲面的动态变化</h3><p>波动率曲面不是静态的，它会随着以下因素动态变化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变化驱动</th>\n<th>曲面响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标的大幅下跌</td>\n<td>整体上移 + 偏斜加大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标的缓慢上涨</td>\n<td>整体下移 + 偏斜减小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重大事件临近</td>\n<td>近月局部抬升（倒挂）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件过后</td>\n<td>近月回落（正常化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恐慌情绪蔓延</td>\n<td>全面抬升 + 曲率增大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[波动率曲面] --&gt; B[行权价维度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[到期时间维度]&#10;    B --&gt; D[微笑/偏斜形态]&#10;    C --&gt; E[期限结构形态]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Skew 变化 = 交易机会]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Term Structure 变化 = 交易机会]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[波动率曲面] --&gt; B[行权价维度]\n    A --&gt; C[到期时间维度]\n    B --&gt; D[微笑/偏斜形态]\n    C --&gt; E[期限结构形态]\n    D --&gt; F[Skew 变化 = 交易机会]\n    E --&gt; G[Term Structure 变化 = 交易机会]\n</pre><h2 id=\"vix-恐慌指数\">VIX 恐慌指数</h2><h3 id=\"定义\">定义</h3><p>VIX（Volatility Index）是由标普 500 指数期权隐含波动率加权计算得到的指数，衡量市场对未来 30 天波动率的预期。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VIX = 100 \\times \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{T}\\sum_i \\frac{\\Delta K_i}{K_i^2} e^{rT} Q(K_i) - \\frac{1}{T}\\left(\\frac{F}{K_0} - 1\\right)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1594em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8818em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.1194em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.1194em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span clas